  "overview": "Mozilla Protocol — the design system for Mozilla branded websites.",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#ffffff) canvas paired with `#ffffff` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#cb9eff` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Inter` across 32 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`4px`), cards (`8px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
}
